---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import SiteNav from '../components/SiteNav.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Dhruv Kadara"
  description="About Dhruv Kadara, his environmental work, community action and personal journey in Mumbai."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <SiteNav />
    <div class="wrap page-hero-content">
      <p class="page-eyebrow">MUMBAI, INDIA</p>
      <h1>About Dhruv</h1>
      <p>Environmental action, community building and creating meaningful change.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <div class="wrap story">
        <div>
          <h2>A little about me.</h2>
          <p class="lede">I’m Dhruv Kadara, an environmentalist and community builder based in Mumbai.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>For several years, I’ve worked on environmental action, volunteer engagement and grassroots initiatives. I believe meaningful environmental change begins when people come together and take action.</p>
          <p>My journey has been shaped by a simple idea: small actions, when multiplied by communities, can create lasting impact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="focus">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>My Story</h2>
        <p>My work has grown around my connection with the environment and the communities working to protect it.</p>
        <p>Over the years, I have been involved in beach cleanups, mangrove conservation, environmental awareness and volunteer-led initiatives. These experiences have allowed me to work with people from different backgrounds and build communities around a shared responsibility for our environment.</p>
        <p>My professional journey also led me into technology, where I have worked in content moderation, data analysis, customer experience and conversational AI. Today, technology is another area I continue to explore alongside my environmental work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap about-ffi">
        <div>
          <h2>For Future India</h2>
          <p>I am a co-founder of For Future India, a youth-led environmental initiative focused on creating practical environmental action through community participation.</p>
          <p>Through the initiative, we have organized beach cleanups, mangrove cleanups, awareness activities and volunteer-driven environmental campaigns.</p>
          <p>The work has brought together thousands of people, including students, volunteers, colleges, organizations and local communities.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.forfutureindia.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore For Future India</a>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/dhruv-hero.png"
          alt="Dhruv with a community of volunteers"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="focus">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What I Care About</h2>
        <div class="tiles about-values">
          <article class="tile">
            <h3>Environmental Action</h3>
            <p>Working with communities to protect beaches, mangroves and natural spaces.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="tile">
            <h3>Community</h3>
            <p>Bringing people together and making it easier for individuals to participate in meaningful causes.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="tile">
            <h3>Sustainability</h3>
            <p>Promoting practical, everyday actions that can contribute to a more sustainable future.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>My Journey</h2>
        <div class="work about-timeline">
          <div><h3>Environmental Action</h3><p>Started working on grassroots environmental initiatives and community engagement.</p></div>
          <div><h3>For Future India</h3><p>Co-founded a youth-led environmental initiative focused on environmental action and volunteer participation.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Community Building</h3><p>Worked with volunteers, students, colleges and organizations on environmental initiatives.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Technology</h3><p>Built professional experience in content moderation, data analysis, customer experience and conversational AI.</p></div>
          <div><h3>Today</h3><p>Continuing environmental and community work while building my career and knowledge in technology and AI.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="involve">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Where I am today</h2>
        <p>Today, I continue to work towards creating environmental awareness and community participation while growing professionally in technology and AI.</p>
        <p>I’m particularly interested in how technology can help people communicate, collaborate and solve real-world problems.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap contact-cta">
        <div>
          <h2>Let's create something meaningful.</h2>
          <p>Whether you want to collaborate on an environmental initiative, community project or simply have an idea to share, I'd love to hear from you.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
